<title>MALAYSIA: CRICKET-ICC TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ICC TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of International</p>
<p>Cricket Council (ICC) Trophy matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Canada beat East and Central Africa by four wickets</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>ECA 179 all out; Canada 180/6 in 46.3 overs;</p>
<p>Bangladesh beat UAE by 110 runs</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Bangladesh 205 all out in 49.3 overs; UAE 95 all out in</p>
<p>34.2 overs</p>
<p>Hong Kong beat Papua New Guinea by 81 runs</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Hong Kong 232/8 in 50 overs; PNG 151 all out in 42 overs</p>
<p>Kenya beat Ireland by 119 runs</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Kenya 247/7 in 50 overs; Ireland 128 all out</p>
<p>USA beat Israel by seven wickets</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Israel 105 all out in 47 overs; USA 108/3 in 24.1 overs</p>
<p>Scotland beat Italy by 131 runs</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Scotland 273 all out in 48.1 overs; Italy 142 all out in</p>
<p>37.2 overs</p>
<p>Denmark beat Argentina by 150 runs</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Denmark 226/8 in 50 overs; Argentina 76 all out in 35.1</p>
<p>overs</p>
<p>Fiji beat Namibia by 105 runs</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Fiji 178/6 in 50 overs; Namibia 73 all out in 33.5 overs</p>
</text>
